WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From standing, bend one knee and place that foot high on the opposite thigh in half-lotus.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Reach the same-side arm behind the back and catch the foot.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Find your balance on the standing leg before beginning to fold.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Hinge forward from the hips, folding over the standing leg.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rest the free hand on the floor or a block, hold, then rise slowly and switch sides.
